; ---- bayonet stab (knife upgrade) -- same setup as the ak74 -----------------
; GS drives these from its [base_bayonet] section, which the knife node inherited;
; that parent does not exist in CS, so the params live on the weapon instead.
; bayonet_hit_time = ms after the quick-kick key when the stab lands (engine default
; 250, ActorInput.cpp:211). The an94's base anm_kick IS the ak74_bayonet motion, so
; the ak74's tuned 210 transfers exactly.
; Gunslinger keeps the AN-94's knife mounted with the GP-25 on (unlike the ak74, where the
; blade and the launcher fight for the barrel), so the GL must not strip it here.
